# Org

`/org/` is a private nested repo (gitignored in the main app). Trackers and [org/bets.md](../../org/bets.md) hold state; founder decides priorities.

- Index: [org/README.md](../../org/README.md) · [org/AGENTS.md](../../org/AGENTS.md)
- Ship code in main repo; public docs in `docs/` — do not copy org into public paths
- No secrets or full email threads in git; `@org-sync` to commit when the user asks
